{
 "source": "Q186c2 (2026-10-05): posterior / shoulder / lumbar / gluteal extension of the female Z-Anatomy trunk refit; build dir build/viewer_zan_female_trunkfix2 (flag --trunk-refit; v5 = build/viewer_zan_female_trunkfix kept as the before). Not published.",
 "owner_request": "fix the shoulder, the waist/lumbar from behind, the buttocks and everything else that needs it",
 "errors_found_in_v5": [
  "buttocks: gluteal/hip skin 11.7 % of vertices outside her CT skin (max 25 mm; protruding 24 mm behind her flat CT back at x=-80, y=100-120) because her outline was not anchored below y=-60, behind the hands, nor with the hand-contact mask over the hips; thigh/gluteal pelvis zone skin 27 % outside her skin",
  "lumbar/waist from behind: lumbar+sacral skin gap to her skin p90 33.6 mm, shelf at the lumbar-gluteal boundary; L3-L5 were already fixed in v5 (1.0-1.1 mm to her labels; the 22-29 mm was the pre-v5 Q168 value)",
  "shoulder: shoulder skin patches stacked/pleated at the supraclavicular + scapular patches, deltoid skin and shoulder-girdle tissue outside the field's lateral reach (|x| > 215 mm)",
  "field fidelity: the 3-D interpolant was anchored on hand/forearm/femur bones whose raw pose differs from hers by up to 340 mm (shears the field around the hips and arms); 5.3 % of sampled points had a Jacobian determinant < 0.25",
  "right 8th costal cartilage 31 mm from her cartilage mesh (Q168 position, no anchor); some cartilages 8-22 mm off her mesh"
 ],
 "fix": [
  "limb bones anchor the field only within 90 mm of a trunk bone (humeral/femoral heads); anchors = refit bones + her own costal-cartilage mesh (rigid ICP, 5 mm support, bound 45 mm; 8th cartilages now anchored)",
  "field = bone-only thin-plate-spline (smoothing 300) + a radial outline correction in her trunk chart (height x angle) smoothed over 1.5 cells, inset 1 mm, fading to zero inside 35-75 % of the local radius, below the crotch (y<-75..-130) and for upper-limb soft tissue below the shoulder; posterior sectors usable from 95 deg (y<190) and every sector at shoulder level (y>=545), lateral band hidden by her arms interpolated from the offsets in front and behind (inpaint_theta, flagged as interpolated); lateral reach of the weight widened to the shoulder girdle",
  "clamp inside her skin (0.5 mm margin, <= 30 mm, Laplacian-spread): every non-bone vertex still outside her CT skin is moved in; forearm/hand/foot regions skipped",
  "volume guard (0.65-1.5 x source x 0.932^3, fallback chain skin-share 1 -> 0.5 -> 0 -> rigid cartilage -> Q168 position) not applied to thin shells (skin, fascia): they fell back to the Q168 position and tore"
 ],
